		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Elle marche.<br />Mais l&#039;ai le message quand je redémarre le serveur.</p><br /><p>postgres@gandalf : ~ &gt;&gt; pg_ctl -m fast restart<br />pg_ctl: PID file &quot;/var/lib/postgresql/9.1/main/postmaster.pid&quot; does not exist<br />Is server running?<br />starting server anyway<br />server starting<br />postgres@gandalf : ~ &gt;&gt; 2013-10-04 14:18:45 GMT FATAL:&#160; lock file &quot;postmaster.pid&quot; already exists<br />2013-10-04 14:18:45 GMT HINT:&#160; Is another postmaster (PID 1221) running in data directory &quot;/srv/postgresql/9.1/main&quot;?</p><br /><p>Que faire pour éliminer</p><p>pg_ctl: PID file &quot;/var/lib/postgresql/9.1/main/postmaster.pid&quot; does not exist<br />Is server running?</p>]]></content>
